{"meta":{"id":"tt34477910","type":"movie","name":"Descendientes: Un malvado País de las Maravillas","imdb_id":"tt34477910","description":"Tras cambiar la historia y evitar que la Reina de Corazones se vuelva malvada, además de salvar a Cenicienta, todo parece perfecto para Red y Chloe. Pero alterar el pasado tiene consecuencias inesperadas. Cuando Maddox Sombrerero, un antiguo amigo de Red, surge como un nuevo villano y captura a la Reina, Red y Chloe deben volver por la madriguera del conejo. Allí, se unen a Pink, la hermana de Red; Luis, el hijo de Luisa Madrigal, y un equipo de villanos liderado por Max, el hijo de Maddox, para salvar a la Reina y a todo el País de las Maravillas.","poster":"https://btttr.cc/poster-q/imdb/poster-default/tt34477910.jpg?tag=none&lang=es-MX&rs=IM","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qlfqDJ9Piv5ufzYA8j2319mwKZU.jpg","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tkJWad7eW3AmGhgE9wtqEuU1aAR.png","genres":["Fantasía","Película de TV","Familia","Aventura"],"releaseInfo":"2026","released":"2026-07-16T12:00:00.000Z","status":"Released","runtime":"95 min","imdbRating":"5.4","country":"United States of America","cast":["Kylie Cantrall","Malia Baker","Liamani Segura","Rita Ora","Brandy Norwood","Leonardo Nam","Alexandro Byrd","Brendon Tremblay","Kiara Romero","Melanie Paxson","Paolo Montalbán","Awkwafina","Joel Oulette","Zavien Garrett","Ryan McEwen","Dayton Paradis","Jalen Saip","Emilia Gomez","Brielle Celis","Avery Hargrave","Ruby Rose Turner","Morgan Dudley","Elwin Alpuerto","Kelly Blancas","Keiran Bohay","Lily Bollegraf","Milaina Chanel","Abbygale Chung","Mariesa Crouse","Kaleah Crump"],"director":["Kimmy Gatewood"],"writer":["Dan Frey","Russell Sommer","Tamara Chestna","Sara Parriott","Josann McGibbon"],"trailers":[{"source":"FI_6BNlG1IE","type":"Trailer","name":"Descendientes: Un malvado País de las Maravillas | Tráiler Doblado | Disney+","ytId":"FI_6BNlG1IE","lang":"es"},{"source":"AGgiTeCCMD0","type":"Trailer","name":"Trái